        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyvinylchloride, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyvinylchloride, at regional storage
see included processes;
CAS number: 009002-86-2; 
Synonyms: PVC; 
UUID: 36f2eccd-a31b-330a-b685-b87163460c36
This dataset establishs an average European PVC mix out of the two important PVC types (suspension, emulsion PVC). Furthermore, this dataset contains an average transport from the production site to a regional storage site.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Present production technology mix.
Time period: date of publication
Production volume: 6.2 Mt (capacity, 2000)
Sampling: data from Industry report 
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_36f2eccd-a31b-330a-b685-b87163460c36.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
